      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLACK SABOTAGE (1) jumped from the pinch last start to lead all the way and score (23.26) at this track in Grade 6 over 400m. Will go close again if runs up to latest. CINTA'S GOLD (2) showed strong early pace and proved too slick around this track over 400m in 23.10, claiming a TG1-4W by 4.5 lengths. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. BLACK STINGRAY (8) produced a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 400m behind Legacy To Burn (23.63) in a Grade 6. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. CINTA'S ME MUM (6) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
